cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: convolve_uv
abstract: >-
  Gaussian convolution of radio astronomy images and spectral cubes, performed directly in the
  uv-plane, so that convolution kernels smaller than the pixel scale are handled without a loss of
  resolution.
authors:
  - given-names: Thomas
    family-names: Williams
    affiliation: "Jodrell Bank Centre for Astrophysics, University of Manchester"
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0012-2142
repository-code: https://github.com/thomaswilliamsastro/convolve_uv
repository-artifact: https://pypi.org/project/convolve-uv/
url: https://convolve-uv.readthedocs.io/en/latest
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - radio astronomy
  - convolution
  - uv-plane
  - spectral cube
  - beam
# The date of the latest release (v0.4.0). Only its year appears in a citation, so it stays correct
# until the year changes; update it when releasing. There is deliberately no `version`: it comes from
# the git tags (setuptools_scm), so a value here would go out of date with every release.
date-released: "2026-09-30"
